      "doi": "10.1364/jocn.606257",
      "title": "Adaptive E2E monitoring path selection with deep reinforcement learning in multi-domain optical networks",
      "authors": [
        "Soham Choudhury",
        "Martin Bojinov",
        "Jason P. Jue",
        "Genya Ishigaki"
      ],
      "year": 2026,
      "venue": "Journal of Optical Communications and Networking",
      "venue_abbr": "JOCN",
      "rank_label": "CIE T2 · 2023",
      "keywords": [
        "end-to-end monitoring",
        "path selection",
        "deep reinforcement learning",
        "multi-domain optical networks",
        "adaptive routing",
        "network monitoring"
      ],
      "url": "https://doi.org/10.1364/jocn.606257",
      "cited_by_count": 0,
      "importance": 1,
      "score_basis": {},
      "role": "root",
      "reading_url": "items/e3b25076-60cd-43b2-9317-fe3dca3328ff.html",
      "summary": "摘要报告：多域光网络切片中域间信息不透明时，切片协调器需选择端到端监测路径以检测与定位链路失效。论文提出初始选择与渐进选择两个互补优化问题，构成闭环自治监测；提出深度强化学习算法自适应选择各阶段最优监测路径集合。基于GNPy光网络仿真器的实验显示该方法在两个问题上均优于基线算法，并在初始选择中接近最优定位，表明AI驱动闭环失效定位在多域光网络中的可行性（预印本）。",
      "summary_basis": "本站解读 · abstract+pdf-link"
    },
